      "microAnimations": [],
      "body": "Two-step verification adds a second step to signing in by magic link: a passkey (Face ID, Touch ID, Windows Hello, security key), a 6-digit code from your authenticator app, or one of your backup codes. It is off until you turn it on in My account, « Security » section.\n\nUntil the second step is done, Jobbbox opens nothing but the page asking for the code: none of your pages, nor the extension, which asks you to finish signing in on Jobbbox. Signing in with a provider, such as Google, asks for no code. The code is asked at every sign-in by magic link, on every device."
